WEBVTT

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:01.173
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.013 --> 00:00:04.099
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you find the dress you wanted for the wedding?

00:00:04.419 --> 00:00:08.143
<v><b>B:</b></v> I found <b>a</b> dress, but not the style I really wanted.

00:00:10.063 --> 00:00:10.736
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:11.610 --> 00:00:13.765
<v><b>A:</b></v> Did you meet anyone new last night?

00:00:14.005 --> 00:00:15.825
<v><b>B:</b></v> I met <b>the</b> guy.

00:00:16.085 --> 00:00:17.042
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>The</b> guy?

00:00:17.174 --> 00:00:20.174
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, the one I’ve been waiting for all my life!